data:{"type":"response.output_item.added","output_index":17,"item":{"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"## Top Feature Areas Driving Negative Sentiment\n\n**AI Tools** leads negative sentiment with 311 reviews (13.0% of all negative feedback), followed closely by **Export** (310 reviews, 13.0%) and **Presentations** (308 reviews, 12.9%). The distribution is relatively balanced across all feature areas, with the gap between the highest and lowest being only 32 reviews. \\[[1](https://fevm-stable-classic-7ppxjq.cloud.databricks.com/genie/rooms/01f11dcb53181defb69ee49bd73bca10/chats/01f190fdb8c1114fa290f19359551991?o=7474660648944264&gra_focus=01f190fdbfda1f6db0c31c75d7839ac1)\\]\n\n### Overall Ranking","annotations":[]},{"type":"output_text","text":"**Top feature areas by negative review count**\n\n| feature_area | negative_review_count | pct_of_negative_reviews |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| AI Tools | 311 | 12.99 |\n| Export | 310 | 12.95 |\n| Presentations | 308 | 12.87 |\n| Design Editor | 306 | 12.78 |\n| Collaboration | 298 | 12.45 |\n| Media Library | 295 | 12.32 |\n| Mobile App | 287 | 11.99 |\n| Templates | 279 | 11.65 |","annotations":[],"metadata":{"sql":"SELECT \n  `feature_area`,\n  COUNT(*) as negative_review_count,\n  ROUND(COUNT(*) * 100.0 / SUM(COUNT(*)) OVER (), 2) as pct_of_negative_reviews\nFROM `stable_classic_7ppxjq_catalog`.`enterpret`.`enriched_reviews`\nWHERE `sentiment_label` = 'negative'\n  AND `feature_area` IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY `feature_area`\nORDER BY negative_review_count DESC","preview_rows":[["AI Tools","311","12.99"],["Export","310","12.95"],["Presentations","308","12.87"],["Design Editor","306","12.78"],["Collaboration","298","12.45"],["Media Library","295","12.32"],["Mobile App","287","11.99"],["Templates","279","11.65"]],"columns":[{"name":"feature_area","type":"STRING"},{"name":"negative_review_count","type":"BIGINT"},{"name":"pct_of_negative_reviews","type":"DECIMAL(27,2)"}],"status":"available","total_row_count":8}},{"type":"output_text","text":"### Changes Over Time\n\nThe available data covers only March 16-17, 2026, which limits temporal analysis. \\[[2](https://fevm-stable-classic-7ppxjq.cloud.databricks.com/genie/rooms/01f11dcb53181defb69ee49bd73bca10/chats/01f190fdb8c1114fa290f19359551991?o=7474660648944264&gra_focus=01f190fdc3f714dab7809ed045ae6570)\\] However, examining the two-day period reveals some notable shifts in the relative distribution:\n\n**March 16 → March 17 ranking changes:**\n- **Presentations** jumped from 4th place (12.7%) to 1st place (18.4% of daily negative reviews)\n- **AI Tools** dropped from 1st place (13.1%) to 7th place (9.2%)\n- **Design Editor** fell from 2nd place (13.1%) to last place (5.8%)","annotations":[]},{"type":"output_text","text":"**Daily negative reviews by feature area with percentages**\n\n| review_date | feature_area | negative_reviews | pct_of_day_negative |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-03-16 | AI Tools | 303 | 13.13 |\n| 2026-03-16 | Design Editor | 301 | 13.05 |\n| 2026-03-16 | Export | 299 | 12.96 |\n| 2026-03-16 | Presentations | 292 | 12.66 |\n| 2026-03-16 | Collaboration | 287 | 12.44 |\n| 2026-03-16 | Media Library | 283 | 12.27 |\n| 2026-03-16 | Mobile App | 275 | 11.92 |\n| 2026-03-16 | Templates | 267 | 11.57 |\n| 2026-03-17 | Presentations | 16 | 18.39 |\n| 2026-03-17 | Media Library | 12 | 13.79 |\n| 2026-03-17 | Templates | 12 | 13.79 |\n| 2026-03-17 | Mobile App | 12 | 13.79 |\n| 2026-03-17 | Export | 11 | 12.64 |\n| 2026-03-17 | Collaboration | 11 | 12.64 |\n| 2026-03-17 | AI Tools | 8 | 9.20 |\n| 2026-03-17 | Design Editor | 5 | 5.75 |","annotations":[],"metadata":{"sql":"SELECT \n  DATE(`review_timestamp`) as review_date,\n  `feature_area`,\n  COUNT(*) as negative_reviews,\n  ROUND(COUNT(*) * 100.0 / SUM(COUNT(*)) OVER (PARTITION BY DATE(`review_timestamp`)), 2) as pct_of_day_negative\nFROM `stable_classic_7ppxjq_catalog`.`enterpret`.`enriched_reviews`\nWHERE `sentiment_label` = 'negative'\n  AND `feature_area` IS NOT NULL\n  AND `review_timestamp` IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY DATE(`review_timestamp`), `feature_area`\nORDER BY review_date, negative_reviews DESC","preview_rows":[["2026-03-16","AI Tools","303","13.13"],["2026-03-16","Design Editor","301","13.05"],["2026-03-16","Export","299","12.96"],["2026-03-16","Presentations","292","12.66"],["2026-03-16","Collaboration","287","12.44"],["2026-03-16","Media Library","283","12.27"],["2026-03-16","Mobile App","275","11.92"],["2026-03-16","Templates","267","11.57"],["2026-03-17","Presentations","16","18.39"],["2026-03-17","Media Library","12","13.79"],["2026-03-17","Templates","12","13.79"],["2026-03-17","Mobile App","12","13.79"],["2026-03-17","Export","11","12.64"],["2026-03-17","Collaboration","11","12.64"],["2026-03-17","AI Tools","8","9.20"],["2026-03-17","Design Editor","5","5.75"]],"columns":[{"name":"review_date","type":"DATE"},{"name":"feature_area","type":"STRING"},{"name":"negative_reviews","type":"BIGINT"},{"name":"pct_of_day_negative","type":"DECIMAL(27,2)"}],"status":"available","total_row_count":16}},{"type":"output_text","text":"While March 17 has limited data (only 87 reviews vs 2,307 on March 16), the shift suggests **Presentations** may be experiencing emerging issues that warrant attention, while concerns about **AI Tools** and **Design Editor** appear to be stabilizing. \\[[3](https://fevm-stable-classic-7ppxjq.cloud.databricks.com/genie/rooms/01f11dcb53181defb69ee49bd73bca10/chats/01f190fdb8c1114fa290f19359551991?o=7474660648944264&gra_focus=01f190fdc811163a9145c32f334fa8f2)\\]","annotations":[]}],"id":"01f190fdd048140094af17fd47ab9f99","status":"completed"},"sequence_number":35}

